From 98ff54ac273579b94c8fadaf4df0198a546c2885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <winshyon@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 18:42:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(noUnusedImports): count JSDoc references anywhere in the
 file

JSDoc types were only collected from comments attached to declarations,
class/object/type members and exports, so a type referenced from a
@packageDocumentation comment before the imports, from a comment before
an expression statement, or from a comment at the end of the file was
reported as unused.

Collect them from the trivia of every token of the file instead.

Closes #8762
